#: ../../examples/notebooks/05_extended_scenes.ipynb:70004
msgid "`image_scene` probes the system: an off-axis PSF is compared with the on-axis one. The coronagraph removes the on-axis star but not the off-axis light: it is not shift-invariant, so the scene is decomposed."
